Q1. Explain Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, Deep Learning, Generative AI, and AI Agent in your own words.
ANS: 1. Artificial Intelligence: It is like human intelligence, it is capable of learning, reasoning and applying knowledge across various domains. It also recognizes errors and solves it.
2. Machine Learning: ML is a system which learns patterns from data individually and classify new info and make predictions. It is a subfield of AI. (ANN)
3. Deep Learning: It is similar to ML but complex. It uses hierarchical approach. It uses multilayered neural networks 
4. Gen AI: It creates new content like AI videos, images based on prompts. Also known as creative AI.
5. AI agent: It is like an organized worker, it decides tasks, tools and interacts with humans as well as other AI agents. It is useful for automation as it requires less/no human interaction.

